; SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
; absptr - Windows 98 SE and ME: absolute pointing devices Windows' own HID
; support does not map to the pointer (docs/design/absptr.md sections 1, 8).
; Copyright (C) 2026 Yeo Kheng Meng
;
; Listed: the Wacom PenPartner (USB\VID_056A&PID_0000) and HID touch
; screens by id, each group with its source (design section 8). Other HID
; touch screens and pens: Update Driver, "Have Disk", this folder. The
; Generic model's id matches no real device; it is the entry "Have Disk"
; offers for them.
; hidclass.sys and hidparse.sys are not copied: they are Microsoft's and
; come with the system's USB HID support, as for xpad98.
[Version]
